#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:827
msgid ""
"Native uses integer scaling. Aspect uses core\n"
"reported aspect ratio. Fullscreen has non-square\n"
"pixels. Cropped is integer scaled then cropped."
msgstr ""
"原生使用整数缩放。宽高比使用核心\n"
"报告的宽高比。全屏具有非方形\n"
"像素。裁剪是整数缩放后裁剪。"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:830
msgid ""
"Native uses integer scaling.\n"
"Aspect uses core reported aspect ratio.\n"
"Fullscreen has non-square pixels."
msgstr ""
"原生使用整数缩放。\n"
"宽高比使用核心报告的宽高比。\n"
"全屏具有非方形像素。"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:855
msgid "Screen Scaling"
msgstr "屏幕缩放"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:865
msgid "Screen Effect"
msgstr "屏幕效果"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:866
msgid ""
"Grid simulates an LCD grid.\n"
"Line simulates CRT scanlines.\n"
"Effects usually look best at native scaling."
msgstr ""
"网格模拟LCD网格。\n"
"线条模拟CRT扫描线。\n"
"效果在原生缩放下通常效果最佳。"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:875
msgid "Screen Sharpness"
msgstr "屏幕锐度"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:876
msgid ""
"Sharp uses nearest neighbor sampling.\n"
"Crisp integer upscales before linear sampling.\n"
"Soft uses linear sampling."
msgstr ""
"锐利使用最近邻采样。\n"
"清晰先整数放大再线性采样。\n"
"柔和使用线性采样。"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:885
msgid "Prevent Tearing"
msgstr "防止撕裂"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:886
msgid ""
"Wait for vsync before drawing the next frame.\n"
"Lenient only waits when within frame budget.\n"
"Strict always waits."
msgstr ""
"绘制下一帧前等待垂直同步。\n"
"宽松模式仅在帧预算内等待。\n"
"严格模式总是等待。"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:895
msgid "CPU Speed"
msgstr "CPU速度"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:896
msgid ""
"Over- or underclock the CPU to prioritize\n"
"pure performance or power savings."
msgstr ""
"超频或降频CPU以优先考虑\n"
"纯性能或省电。"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:905
msgid "Prioritize Audio"
msgstr "优先音频"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:906
msgid ""
"Can eliminate crackle but\n"
"may cause dropped frames.\n"
"Only turn on if necessary."
msgstr ""
"可以消除爆音但\n"
"可能导致掉帧。\n"
"仅在必要时开启。"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:915
msgid "Debug HUD"
msgstr "调试HUD"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:916
msgid ""
"Show frames per second, cpu load,\n"
"resolution, and scaler information."
msgstr ""
"显示每秒帧数、CPU负载、\n"
"分辨率和缩放器信息。"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:925
msgid "Max FF Speed"
msgstr "最大快进速度"

#: ../../minarch/minarch.c:926
msgid ""
"Fast forward will not exceed the\n"
"selected speed (but may be less\n"
"depending on game and emulator)."
msgstr ""
"快进不会超过\n"
"选择的速度（但可能更慢\n"
"取决于游戏和模拟器）。"

